    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in 1985, you take on the role of a member of the M.E.G. (Major Explorer Group) a faction formed within the Backrooms to explore uncharted levels and make them safer for wanderers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During an expedition, you unknowingly stumble into one of the most dangerous levels known: <strong>Level !</strong>. There\u2019s no time to think. You have but one objective from there:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run for your life.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: The Descent</strong> is an indie horror exploration/survival game that follows the lore of the Backrooms Wiki/Fandom, featuring eerie liminal spaces,\u00a0<strong>resources you must manage</strong> to stay alive and various <strong>togglable entities</strong> within select levels, that you must avoid while navigating your way through for any sign of human life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Togglable entities, for people that just want to enjoy liminal spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 initial lore accurate levels with variation and difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints/ saves at the beginning of every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management (food and water etc.)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set in 1985, you take on the role of a member of the M.E.G. (Major Explorer Group) a faction formed within the Backrooms to explore uncharted levels and make them safer for wanderers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During an expedition, you unknowingly stumble into one of the most dangerous levels known: <strong>Level !</strong>. There\u2019s no time to think. You have but one objective from there:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run for your life.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: The Descent</strong> is an indie horror exploration/survival game that follows the lore of the Backrooms Wiki/Fandom, featuring eerie liminal spaces,\u00a0<strong>resources you must manage</strong> to stay alive and various <strong>togglable entities</strong> within select levels, that you must avoid while navigating your way through for any sign of human life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Togglable entities, for people that just want to enjoy liminal spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 initial lore accurate levels with variation and difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints/ saves at the beginning of every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management (food and water etc.)</p></li></ul>",
